# 13. Very Important: How Props Work

Think about props like this:

```jsx
<NewsItem title="Hello World" />
```

The parent is saying:

> "NewsItem, here is some data for you."

The child receives it as:

```jsx
this.props.title
```

So:

```text
Parent
  |
  | title = "Hello World"
  ↓
Child
  |
  ↓
this.props.title
```

