# 17. API Key

An API key is used to authenticate the application with the news service.

Example structure:

```text
https://newsapi.org/v2/top-headlines
```

The request can contain information such as:

```text
country
category
apiKey
```

Example:

```text
top-headlines?country=us&apiKey=YOUR_API_KEY
```

### Important

I should **not upload my real API key to GitHub**.

Instead, I should keep it in an environment variable such as:

```text
.env
```

and add `.env` to `.gitignore`.

